**PHASE 16 — Unified Gameplay HUD & Navigation System**

Bring the existing gameplay interfaces together into a coherent HUD with backpack, missions, discoveries, map, audio settings and pause/navigation controls.

**PHASE 17 — Visual Polish, Audio Design & Performance Optimisation**

Improve planetary materials, lighting, atmosphere, environment detail, transitions, optional audio, interaction feedback, graphics settings and rendering performance.

**PHASE 18 — Complete Application Audit, Performance Optimisation & Bug Fixing**

Conduct a thorough technical review of the existing application, fix verified defects, optimise performance, inspect memory usage and run regression tests.

**PHASE 19 — Student Experience, Accessibility & Educational Usability**

Evaluate the entire student journey and improve usability, accessibility, understandable controls, educational clarity and independent task completion.

**PHASE 20 — Final Integration, End-to-End Validation & Production Deployment**

Integrate the complete game, verify the full gameplay journey, complete documentation, prepare production assets and configure a suitable free static hosting solution.

